ipeline for element-level assessment using SPI	Jiang, Lan; Ying, Xiangji; Brown, Andrew W; et al.					Elicit set	SysRev-LLMApp / SysRev - Elicit 2026-11-24	OASIS Lab, personal	4	abstract (Zotero)	False	no DOI: not checked	True	False			Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.908	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.866	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.882	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.832	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.804	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.622	0.898	personal:5S2PM6I6
