Methods: RoB2-Evaluator was developed using GPT-5.2 with fixed RoB 2 guidance and a locked instruction framework. Seven RCTs were used for calibration before version freezing. The frozen system was evaluated on 10 separate RCTs, with repeat assessment after one week and comparison against consensus judgments from two independent human reviewers.
