ing asked to explain their r	Guo, Eddie; Gupta, Mehul; Deng, Jiawen; et al.	2023		10.2196/48996		(other folder)	Undermind	OASIS Lab	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://www.jmir.org/2024/1/e48996/PDF	True	False		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers; Models split	Peer review reports	0.916	Peer review reports	0.913	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.891	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.868	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.794	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.789	0.874	OASIS Lab:PVIXUCXA
