nt with published conclusions. ChatGPT and Gemini accurately identified 	Mao, Gordon; Snyder, William; Chinthala, Anoop S.; et al.	2026	Scientific Reports	10.1038/s41598-026-45326-2	https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-026-45326-2	Elicit set	SysRev-LLMApp / SysRev - Elicit 2026-11-24	OASIS Lab, personal	3	PDF (abstract section)	True	https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-026-45326-2_reference.pdf	True	False		Models split	NEW	0.897	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.867	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.877	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.837	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.805	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.74	0.861	personal:YUSE8RW5
