inary screening assistants that help draw attentio	Nazarovets, Serhii; Teixeira da Silva, Jaime A.	2026	Journal of Academic Ethics	10.1007/s10805-026-09761-0	https://doi.org/10.1007/s10805-026-09761-0	SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	personal	1	abstract (Zotero)	False		True	False		Models split	Peer review reports	0.935	Peer review reports	0.914	NEW	0.854	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.854	NEW	0.789	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.753	0.862	personal:R4Y9ND8U
