o consistently apply the RoB tool and revisions to the tool for different health areas are need	Armijo-Olivo, S.; Ospina, M.; costa, B. Da; et al.	2014		10.1371/journal.pone.0096920		(other folder)	Undermind	OASIS Lab	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article/file?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0096920&type=printable	True	False		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers; Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.84	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.788	NEW	0.807	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.755	NEW	0.678	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.613	0.855	OASIS Lab:PVHYFAAM
