hts the potential of frontier LLMs to detect and correct objective mistakes in publis	Bianchi, Federico; Kwon, Yongchan; Izzo, Zachary; et al.	2025	arXiv	10.48550/arxiv.2512.05925	http://arxiv.org/abs/2512.05925	Elicit set; SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp | SysRev-LLMApp / SysRev - Elicit 2026-11-24	OASIS Lab, personal	6	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://arxiv.org/pdf/2512.05925	True	False		Models split	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.918	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.918	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.875	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.846	NEW	0.775	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.758	0.857	OASIS Lab:4U2S6VK6
