y when assessing items requiring nuance and contextual understanding across both checklists. Currently, any ad	Shereefdeen, Hisba; Thaivalappil, Abhinand; Young, Ian; et al.	2025	INQUIRY: The Journal of Health Care Organization, Provision, and Financing	10.1177/00469580251399374	https://doi.org/10.1177/00469580251399374	SysRev-LLMApp pool	Jay IP and Preprint | SysRev-LLMApp	OASIS Lab, personal	3	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://doi.org/10.1177/00469580251399374	False	False			NEW	0.895	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.874	NEW	0.861	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.807	NEW	0.765	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.701	0.848	personal:ACNU2TNJ
