acy rate close to 90\%, with 95.0\% on easy questions, significantly outperforming the other LLMs. This indicates GPT-4o's poten	Liu, Mingxin; Ma, Tsuyoshi; Okuhara; et al.	2024		10.1101/2024.07.09.24310129		(other folder)	Undermind	OASIS Lab	2	abstract (Zotero)	False		True	False		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers	NEW	0.865	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.849	NEW	0.863	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.847	NEW	0.746	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.746	0.839	OASIS Lab:BHHAKA8L
