ng relevant articles, leading to significant time and effort savings. Our quantitative assessment reveals 	Alshami, Ahmad; Elsayed, Moustafa; Ali, Eslam; et al.	2023	Systems	10.3390/systems11070351	https://www.mdpi.com/2079-8954/11/7/351	SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://www.mdpi.com/2079-8954/11/7/351/pdf?version=1688974508	True	False			NEW	0.895	Peer review reports	0.888	NEW	0.852	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.804	NEW	0.736	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.705	0.831	OASIS Lab:5MPV99S6
