m systematic reviews and experience-based articles, recommendations for the use of AI resour	Barragán, Ana M.; Bonett, Sara Elena Ortiz; Rodríguez-Grande, Eliana-Isabel; et al.	2026	Cochrane Evidence Synthesis and Methods	10.1002/cesm.70098	https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/cesm.70098	SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	personal	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/pdfdirect/10.1002/cesm.70098	True	True			NEW	0.89	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.869	NEW	0.859	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.848	NEW	0.734	Peer review reports	0.697	0.83	personal:GL9AWV6L
