plications of ChatGPT can induce paradigm shifts in health care education, research, and practice. Howev	Sallam, Malik	2023		10.3390/healthcare11060887		(other folder)	Undermind	OASIS Lab	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://www.mdpi.com/2227-9032/11/6/887/pdf?version=1679359384	True	False		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers	NEW	0.886	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.844	NEW	0.865	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.832	NEW	0.711	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.686	0.821	OASIS Lab:8GIG5864
