ially increase the number of submissions within a contest) and mo				10.1287/isre.2022.1184	https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/full/10.1287/isre.2022.1184	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	HTML snapshot	True	https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.3758338	False	True			NEW	0.801	Peer review reports	0.787	NEW	0.77	Peer review reports	0.768	NEW	0.578	Peer review reports	0.576	0.738	OASIS Lab:3CRFB9B5
