id	Lichter, Peter; Allgayer, Heike; Bartsch, Helmut; Fusenig, Norbert E.; Hemminki, Kari; von Knebel Doeberitz, Magnus; Kyewski, Bruno; Miller, Anthony B.; Hausen, Harald zur	2009	International journal of cancer	10.1002/ijc.24985		SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	OASIS Lab, personal	2	abstract (Zotero)	False		False	False		Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.756	Peer review reports	0.754	NEW	0.782	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.753	NEW	0.528	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.494	0.724	OASIS Lab:3CNI8HB2
