ts. However, an overall pattern showin	Lee-Easton, Miranda J.; Magura, Stephen; Maranda, Michael J.	2022	INQUIRY: The Journal of Health Care Organization, Provision, and Financing	10.1177/00469580221126295	https://doi.org/10.1177/00469580221126295	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://doi.org/10.1177/00469580221126295	False	False		Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.761	Assess ethical matters	0.759	NEW	0.751	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.738	NEW	0.502	Assess ethical matters	0.496	0.705	OASIS Lab:PFDXQJLY
