iterature	Gotyi, Zamikhaya Gladwell; Majee, Wilson	2025	Frontiers in Sustainable Cities	10.3389/frsc.2025.1519100		SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	OASIS Lab, personal	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/sustainable-cities/articles/10.3389/frsc.2025.1519100/pdf	False	False			NEW	0.697	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.697	NEW	0.713	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.702	NEW	0.414	Assess ethical matters	0.397	0.619	OASIS Lab:5JZK6C82
