ogies as well as the persistent “publish or perish” pressures on	Ioannidis, John P. A.; Berkwits, Michael; Flanagin, Annette; et al.	2023	JAMA	10.1001/jama.2023.17607	https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2023.17607	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://jamanetwork.com/journals/jama/articlepdf/2809861/jama_ioannidis_2023_ed_230074_1696283289.40189.pdf	False	True			NEW	0.864	Peer review reports	0.857	NEW	0.791	Peer review reports	0.783	NEW	0.64	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.632	0.79	OASIS Lab:6CRWLSBT
