 and innovation can be unl	Lu, Chris; Lu, Cong; Lange, Robert Tjarko; et al.	2024	arXiv		http://arxiv.org/abs/2408.06292	(other folder)		OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	False	no DOI: not checked	True	False		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers	NEW	0.893	Peer review reports	0.891	NEW	0.847	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.842	NEW	0.705	Peer review reports	0.701	0.826	OASIS Lab:E5MRNRR8
