i	Mitchener, Ludovico; Yiu, Angela; Chang, Benjamin; et al.	2025	arXiv	10.48550/arxiv.2511.02824	http://arxiv.org/abs/2511.02824	(other folder)		OASIS Lab, personal	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.02824	True	True		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers	NEW	0.873	Peer review reports	0.871	NEW	0.822	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.788	NEW	0.614	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.578	0.783	personal:22MW94PU
