s in the following categories: Gunning 	Gage Guerra; Sophie Grove; Jonathan Le; et al.	2024	Journal of neurosurgery	10.3171/2024.6.jns24617		(other folder)	Undermind	OASIS Lab	2	abstract (Zotero)	False		False	False		Not in an ingest folder: found because it is close to the seed and Elicit papers	NEW	0.849	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.814	NEW	0.871	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.823	NEW	0.766	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.678	0.832	OASIS Lab:PGTZCQQN
