ogies, specifically ChatGPT, on past reporting standards and the need	Alnaimat, Fatima; Al-Halaseh, Salameh; AlSamhori, Abdel Rahman Feras	2024	Journal of Korean medical science	10.3346/jkms.2024.39.e231		SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	OASIS Lab, personal	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	http://jkms.org/Synapse/Data/PDFData/0063JKMS/jkms-39-e231.pdf	False	False			NEW	0.878	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.857	NEW	0.825	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.806	NEW	0.73	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.699	0.82	OASIS Lab:QEK8HSB6
