ddressed to enable further development and testing of our propo	Whaley, Paul; Wattam, Stephen; Scott, Anna Mae; et al.	2023	Evidence-Based Toxicology	10.1080/2833373x.2023.2259938	https://doi.org/10.1080/2833373X.2023.2259938	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://doi.org/10.1080/2833373x.2023.2259938	True	False			NEW	0.852	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.826	NEW	0.829	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.804	NEW	0.687	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.672	0.815	OASIS Lab:69I3ZH5N
