n the adherence to NIH rigor criteria, as determined by a s	Piekniewska, Agata; Anderson, Nathan; Roelandse, Martijn; Lloyd, K C Kent; Korf, Ian; Voss, S Randal; de Castro, Giovanni; Magnani, Diogo M; Varga, Zoltan; James-Zorn, Christina; Horb, Marko; Grethe, Jeffery S; Bandrowski, Anita	2024	bioRxiv : the preprint server for biology	10.1101/2024.01.15.575636		SysRev-LLMApp pool	SysRev-LLMApp	OASIS Lab, personal	2	abstract (Zotero)	False		False	False			NEW	0.823	Peer review reports	0.822	NEW	0.793	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.748	NEW	0.594	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.565	0.78	OASIS Lab:2247KDY4
