onc	Jamieson, Michelle K.; Govaart, Gisela H.; Pownall, Madeleine	2023	Social and Personality Psychology Compass	10.1111/spc3.12735	https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1111/spc3.12735	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	2	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://doi.org/10.1111/spc3.12735	False	True			NEW	0.732	Peer review reports	0.724	NEW	0.766	Peer review reports	0.75	NEW	0.551	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.549	0.721	OASIS Lab:QAX46WMC
