regation consists of the satisfactorily ending consequenc	Hannes, Karin; Lockwood, Craig	2011	Journal of Advanced Nursing	10.1111/j.1365-2648.2011.05636.x	https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1111/j.1365-2648.2011.05636.x	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	False		False	False		Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.81	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.773	NEW	0.799	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.767	NEW	0.572	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.519	0.738	OASIS Lab:UBMFVY8Y
