 enhances levels of corrective acti	Brookes, Paul S.	2014	PeerJ	10.7717/peerj.313	https://peerj.com/articles/313	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://peerj.com/articles/313.pdf	True	False		Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.799	Peer review reports	0.796	NEW	0.789	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.768	NEW	0.572	Detect errors / limitations / quality issues	0.547	0.741	OASIS Lab:EDRDLCFQ
