y (CCES) of the 2016 US presidential election suggest a $\rho_{{	Meng, Xiao-Li	2018	The Annals of Applied Statistics	10.1214/18-aoas1161sf	https://projecteuclid.org/journals/annals-of-applied-statistics/volume-12/issue-2/Statistical-paradises-and-paradoxes-in-big-data-I--Law/10.1214/18-AOAS1161SF.full	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	abstract (Zotero)	True	https://projecteuclid.org/journals/annals-of-applied-statistics/volume-12/issue-2/Statistical-paradises-and-paradoxes-in-big-data-I--Law/10.1214/18-AOAS1161SF.pdf	True	False		Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.772	Causal inference	0.761	NEW	0.757	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.754	NEW	0.546	Peer review reports	0.517	0.715	OASIS Lab:XYISFI45
