	Møller, Morten Hylander; Ioannidis, John P. A.; Darmon, Michael	2018	Intensive Care Medicine	10.1007/s00134-017-5039-y	https://doi.org/10.1007/s00134-017-5039-y	Metascience	Metascience	OASIS Lab	1	PDF (abstract section)	True	https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s00134-017-5039-y.pdf	True	False		Published 2022 or earlier: check that it involves LLMs	NEW	0.834	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.762	NEW	0.822	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.783	NEW	0.63	Check  reporting guideline compliance	0.601	0.762	OASIS Lab:PRW7UFXL
